<title>UK: Provend shares little changed on debut.</title>
<headline>Provend shares little changed on debut.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Provend Group Plc, a vending machine company, were little changed from their issue price as they began trading on London Stock Exchange on Monday.</p>
<p>The shares traded at 125-1/2p by 0945 GMT, compared with a placing price of 125p. Trading was active with volume reaching 1.4 million shares.</p>
<p>The placing raised 7.9 million stg net and valued the company at 21.6 million stg. Proceeds of the float will be used to finance the group's expansion and reduce borrowing.</p>
<p>-- John Sutherland, London Newsroom +44 171 542 7945</p>
